# PlatformBox design (ENFORCED)

Ultra-premium B2B. Visual north stars: Linear.app / Vercel. Strict dark mode.

## Tokens (must remain in `src/app/globals.css`)

- `--background`, `--foreground`, `--muted`, `--accent`, `--accent-hover`
- `@import "tailwindcss"` + `@theme inline` mapping
- Accent = electric blue (not purple/indigo defaults)

## Landing composition

1. Hero — brand, one H1, one supporting sentence, CTA pair; no stats/chips clutter
2. Problem — one job
3. Deliverables — 2×2 glass bento
4. Economics — ROI + distinct `$20,000 USD` / `14 Days` card
5. Footer — copyright, email, LinkedIn

## UX

- Primary CTA: solid accent. Secondary: outline/glass.
- Cards for deliverables/ROI only — never hero cards.
- Calm motion only; fully responsive.
- Keep approved copy unless the user supplies new copy.
